-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Everyone's a Wally
  Publisher   Mikro-Gen, 1985
  Version     1.0

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Everyone's a Wally (1985)(Mikro-Gen).z80
  MD5         6a314faecd0b5e52ad9ef612d72e214f

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  file: anything else is refused, with a message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Colours     Default (the game's own) plus: Enhanced, chosen on the menu, off
              by default.
  Enhanced    Characters painted as people: Wally in a light-blue jacket and
              blue trousers with a grey cap and pink face, others with their
              own hair, skin and clothes colours. Source: enhanced colours
              from an older Spec256 conversion (the EmuZWin games package),
              painter not established.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  Immunity
   3  Change character anywhere

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

